Options -Indexes
ServerSignature Off

<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header always unset X-Powered-By
    Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
</IfModule>

# Bloquear ficheiros ocultos e de backup
<FilesMatch "(^\.|\.(bak|old|sql|log|ini|sh|swp)$|~$)">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
